---
{
    "layout": "master.njk",
    "title": "Games Like Outer Wilds",
    "createDate": "2026-06-18",
    "excludeFromRecent": true,
    "updateDate": "2026-11-02"
}
---
{% from "spoiler.njk" import spoiler %}
{% from "sidenote.njk" import sidenote %}
{% from "link.njk" import externalLink %}
{% from "imagegallery.njk" import articleImage %}
{% set tierLabels = {
    "S": "S",
    "A": "A",
    "B": "B",
    "C": "C",
    "PuzzleBox": "Puzzle Box",
    "Borderline": "Borderline",
    "NotGLOW": "Not Like Outer Wilds"
} %}

<p>
    Outer Wilds is my favorite game. I've played many games in search of another Game Like Outer Wilds. This page contains my thoughts on each one.
    I also post these reviews on {{externalLink("https://gameslikeouterwilds.substack.com/", "Substack!")}}
</p> 
<p>
    <a href="/glow/about/">What makes a game Like Outer Wilds?</a>
</p>

<h3>Recently played</h3>
<ol class="recently-added">
{%- for game in collections.glowRecent %}
<li><span class="mono">{{ game.data.createDate }}</span> :: <a href="{{ game.url }}">{{ game.data.title }}</a> :: <em>{{ tierLabels[game.data.tier] }} tier</em></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>

<h2>S Tier</h2>
<div class="fullrow"><div class="tierlist">
{%- for game in collections.glowS %}
{% include "glowsummary.njk" %}
{%- endfor %}
</div></div>

