    Puzzle Boxes are similar to Epiphany Games, except they lack worldbuilding.
</p></div>
<div class="fullrow"><div class="tierlist">
{%- for game in collections.glowPuzzleBox %}
{% include "glowsummary.njk" %}
{%- endfor %}
</div></div>

